  "user_id": 1574,
  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Display All Profiles\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Use your arrays from the previous level.\r\n\r\n2. Prompt AI to refactor your code so it uses `.map()` to display all of your profiles.\r\n\r\n3. Review the code AI gives you:\r\n   * Make sure it uses `.map()`\r\n   * Make sure it uses the same `index` across all arrays\r\n   * Make sure it calls `createProfile()` for each item\r\n\r\n4. Run your code and check:\r\n   * Are all 3 profiles displayed?\r\n   * Does each profile show matching information?\r\n\r\n### Reminder:\r\n- `.map()` repeats the same code for every item\r\n- The same index should be used across all arrays",
    "submittable": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
    "ai_tutor_mode": "engineer",
    "predict_settings": {
      "isPredictLevel": false,
      "solution": "",
      "questionType": "freeResponse",
